## How to Select a Bounty Target
If you plan to use this index to format your proof of concepts on platforms like [HackerOne](https://hackerone.com/paypal) or [Bugcrowd](https://www.bugcrowd.com/glossary/common-weakness-enumeration-cwe/), keep in mind that memory-safe languages (Rust, Go, Java) automatically block categories 1 through 10.
If you are hunting for these specific bugs, focus on target software written in C, C++, assembly, or smart contract languages (Solidity).
